{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","text":"Components","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Components are in the order Tarjan’s algorithm completes them, on a depth-first search","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with roots in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order and successors in ","type":"text"},{"code":"successors(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order. That is a reverse","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"topological order of the condensation: every edge between components goes from a later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component to an earlier one, so ","type":"text"},{"code":"reversed()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" lists the components with every edge going","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"forward. Each component lists its vertices in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each component’s first vertex is its earliest in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":", so on a graph whose vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positions are insertion order ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StableDirectedGraph"},{"type":"text","text":"), one sort by that vertex’s position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"puts the components in insertion order, O(C log C) for C components:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let inInsertionOrder = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","    .sorted { graph.vertexPosition(of: $0.first!) < graph.vertexPosition(of: $1.first!) }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On any graph, one pass over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" lists them in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, O(V):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let components = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","let inVertexOrder = graph.vertices.compactMap { vertex in","    let component = components[components.component(of: vertex)]","    return component.first == vertex ? component : nil","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Complexity","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(V + E)."}]}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Connectivity\/StronglyConnectedComponents.swift#L148","fileName":"StronglyConnectedComponents.swift"},"role":"symbol","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","text":"Components"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Connectivity"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P12ConnectivityE27stronglyConnectedComponentsAD0G0VyxGyF","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tarjan’s algorithm."}],"references":{"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/connectivity","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","title":"Connectivity","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/Components":{"url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/components","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Components"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Components"}],"title":"Components","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A partition of a graph’s vertices into components, in a documented order: a collection of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components, each a slice of vertices in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, with an O(1) "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"component(of:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","role":"